{
  "id": "E410",
  "title": "Lay Eggs?",
  "level": "newbie",
  "date": "2020-03-05",
  "synopsis": "Little Ming is curious if his mother can lay eggs. Why would he think that?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/50410/37ccbb41cbbd0a7ea9105defcd125be45bff0f37.mp3?1582295754",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "你会生蛋吗\n\n小明：妈妈，小红的妈妈游泳游得很好。你为什么不会呢？\n小明的妈妈：她每天都吃鱼，所以会游泳。我不吃鱼。怎么会游泳呢？\n小明：那你每天吃鸡。你会生蛋吗？\n",
    "traditional": "你會生蛋嗎\n\n小明：媽媽，小紅的媽媽游泳游得很好。你為什麼不會呢？\n小明的媽媽：她每天都吃魚，所以會游泳。我不吃魚。怎麼會游泳呢？\n小明：那你每天吃雞。你會生蛋嗎？\n"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Can you lay eggs"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小明：妈妈，小红的妈妈游泳游得很好。你为什么不会呢？",
      "traditional": "小明：媽媽，小紅的媽媽游泳游得很好。你為什麼不會呢？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng mā ma xiǎo hóng de mā ma yóu yǒng yóu de hěn hǎo nǐ wèi shén me bú huì ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming: Mom, Little Hong’s mom swims very well. Why can’t you?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小明的妈妈：她每天都吃鱼，所以会游泳。我不吃鱼。怎么会游泳呢？",
      "traditional": "小明的媽媽：她每天都吃魚，所以會游泳。我不吃魚。怎麼會游泳呢？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng de mā ma tā měi tiān dōu chī yú suǒ yǐ huì yóu yǒng wǒ bù chī yú zěn me huì yóu yǒng ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming’s mom: She eats fish every day, and she can swim as a result. I don’t eat fish. How could I swim?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小明：那你每天吃鸡。你会生蛋吗？",
      "traditional": "小明：那你每天吃雞。你會生蛋嗎？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng nà nǐ měi tiān chī jī nǐ huì shēng dàn ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming: In that case, you eat chicken every day. Can you lay eggs?"
    }
  ],
